---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy | Gill Gas and Electrical Ltd"
  description="How Gill Gas and Electrical Ltd handles your name, phone number and email when you ask for a quote. No cookies and no analytics on this site."
  path="/privacy"
>
  <main id="main">
    <header class="page-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> <span>/</span> Privacy</p>
        <h1>Privacy</h1>
        <p class="lede">This page says what happens to your details. It is written for customers, not for a legal template.</p>
      </div>
    </header>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="wrap prose">
        <p>
          The data controller is {site.legalName}, company number {site.companyNumber}, {site.street}, {site.locality}, {site.town}, {site.postcode}.
          Email {site.email} or call {site.phoneDisplay}.
        </p>
        <h2>What this website collects</h2>
        <p>
          The site does not use analytics, advertising cookies, or a contact database.
          The quote form does not post your message to a server. It opens an email to {site.email} on your own device.
          If you send that email, we receive whatever you typed: usually your name, phone number, email, postcode and a note about the job.
        </p>
        <h2>Why we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          We use those details to reply, to quote, and to do the work if you book it. The legal basis is steps before a contract, and then the contract itself.
          We do not sell the list. We do not add you to a newsletter.
        </p>
        <h2>How long</h2>
        <p>
          Quote emails are kept long enough to answer you and, if you become a customer, for the invoices and the gas or electrical certificates the job needs.
          Landlord gas records and electrical certificates have their own retention rules. Ask if you want a copy of what we hold about a job.
        </p>
        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You can ask for a copy of your details, ask us to correct them, or ask us to delete them where the law allows.
          You can also complain to the Information Commissioner’s Office at ico.org.uk.
        </p>
        <h2>Other sites</h2>
        <p>
          Links to Google Maps, Companies House, the Gas Safe Register, NAPIT and the Renewable Energy Consumer Code leave this site.
          Those sites have their own privacy notices. We do not control them.
        </p>
        <p>This notice was written on {site.checked}.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
